Gambling","Life Sim","Multiplayer","Resource Management","Simulation","Survival","Time Management"],"title":"Yayos","watchData":{"description":"Sark's Yayos archive follows four co-op survival sessions: two nights learning the elderly life-management gauntlet with APL, a Diction return that reaches one day and fifteen hours, and a Stu run after Sark has climbed to 55th on the global leaderboard.","groups":[{"chapters":[{"id":"yayos_apl_first_night_setup","kind":"bonus","segments":[{"endSeconds":7684,"label":"Sark pitches APL the elderly survival premise, gets the co-op room working, inspects the 22-day global record and discovers that a run ends the moment either grandparent dies.","startSeconds":7301,"videoId":"pgrUXWWusPw"}],"title":"What Is Yayos? / Global Leaderboard"},{"id":"yayos_apl_first_night_early_wipes","segments":[{"endSeconds":9573,"label":"The first cluster of attempts teaches the pair how medication schedules, falls, shared money, walkers and cooking actually work, mostly by killing them while they learn.","startSeconds":7684,"videoId":"pgrUXWWusPw"}],"title":"Runs 01-04 - Pills, Falls & Walkers"},{"id":"yayos_apl_first_night_first_full_day","segments":[{"endSeconds":10612,"label":"Their first serious survival push splits the labor between meal prep and town exploration until APL discovers scratch tickets and the run finally clears roughly a full in-game day.","startSeconds":9573,"videoId":"pgrUXWWusPw"}],"title":"Run 05 - Scratchers & the First Full Day"},{"id":"yayos_apl_first_night_grocery_recon","segments":[{"endSeconds":11111,"label":"A short exploration run maps more of the neighborhood, finds the bar and shopping-cart logic, and dies while trying to understand how to survive away from the house.","startSeconds":10612,"videoId":"pgrUXWWusPw"}],"title":"Run 06 - Grocery Recon"},{"id":"yayos_apl_first_night_one_day_twelve_hours","segments":[{"endSeconds":11721,"label":"With better pill timing and a clearer grocery plan, Sark and APL push their best score to one day and twelve hours.","startSeconds":11111,"videoId":"pgrUXWWusPw"}],"title":"Run 07 - One Day, 12 Hours"},{"id":"yayos_apl_first_night_grocery_cart_push","segments":[{"endSeconds":13616,"label":"They turn the radio and TV into mood management, haul the grocery cart out for beef and onions, and get closer to assembling the elusive first cooked meal before the run collapses.","startSeconds":11721,"videoId":"pgrUXWWusPw"}],"title":"Run 08 - The Grocery Cart Push"},{"id":"yayos_apl_first_night_bad_pill_sync","segments":[{"endSeconds":14114,"label":"Another attempt turns into a co-op troubleshooting session when APL's apparently correct pills repeatedly poison him, forcing both players to relaunch the game.","startSeconds":13616,"videoId":"pgrUXWWusPw"}],"title":"Run 09 - The Co-op Pill Bug"},{"id":"yayos_apl_first_night_one_day_nineteen_hours","segments":[{"endSeconds":15950,"label":"After the relaunch and a brief review of the game's spectacular bathroom physics, the final run reaches one day and nineteen hours, gets the meal farther than ever, and ends in a game-specific postmortem and Steam-review read.","startSeconds":14114,"videoId":"pgrUXWWusPw"}],"title":"Run 10 - One Day, 19 Hours"}],"id":"yayos-apl-first-night","people":["APL Fisher"],"title":"First Night - APL"},{"chapters":[{"id":"yayos_apl_return_run_01","segments":[{"endSeconds":13614,"label":"Sark and APL return with phone screenshots of their medication schedules, divide cooking and shopping duties, and immediately rediscover how one bad fall or pill interaction can erase a run.","startSeconds":12250,"videoId":"9Wkct-mvZXA"}],"title":"Run 01 - Back on the Medication Clock"},{"id":"yayos_apl_return_run_02","segments":[{"endSeconds":14400,"label":"A second attempt gets the kitchen moving more cleanly but ends when the interaction controls break badly enough that Sark has to force-quit and rebuild the lobby.","startSeconds":13614,"videoId":"9Wkct-mvZXA"}],"title":"Run 02 - Force-Quit Grandpa"},{"id":"yayos_apl_return_run_03","segments":[{"endSeconds":15674,"label":"Their final return run gets the short recipe into the pot and keeps it boiling while they fight medication RNG, falls, naps and starvation, still chasing the first completed meal when the session ends.","startSeconds":14400,"videoId":"9Wkct-mvZXA"}],"title":"Run 03 - Boiling the White Whale"}],"id":"yayos-apl-return","people":["APL Fisher"],"title":"APL Return - The Meal White Whale"},{"chapters":[{"id":"yayos_diction_lottery_death","segments":[{"endSeconds":1405,"label":"Sark gives Diction the Yayos crash course and the first attempt ends exactly where it should: stranded at the scratch tickets while one of them dies.","startSeconds":794,"videoId":"eKlS0paRCeE"}],"title":"Run 01 - Lottery Death"},{"id":"yayos_diction_heart_attack_run","segments":[{"endSeconds":2036,"label":"The second run gets farther into the neighborhood and ingredient hunt before the elderly body-management systems win again with a heart-attack death.","startSeconds":1405,"videoId":"eKlS0paRCeE"}],"title":"Run 02 - Groceries & a Heart Attack"},{"id":"yayos_diction_fixing_the_pills","kind":"bonus","segments":[{"endSeconds":2260,"label":"Diction's medication list fails to populate, so the pair reset to the menu and wait out the co-op sync bug before trying again.","startSeconds":2036,"videoId":"eKlS0paRCeE"}],"title":"Fixing the Co-op Medication List"},{"id":"yayos_diction_one_day_fifteen_hours","segments":[{"endSeconds":3220,"label":"With the pills finally visible, Sark and Diction coordinate the beef-and-onion grocery run, nearly get a meal cooking and post a one-day-fifteen-hour score before checking the leaderboard and moving on.","startSeconds":2260,"videoId":"eKlS0paRCeE"}],"title":"Run 03 - One Day, 15 Hours"}],"id":"yayos-diction-night","people":["Diction"],"title":"Diction's First Night"},{"chapters":[{"id":"yayos_stu_55th_tutorial","kind":"bonus","segments":[{"endSeconds":2215,"label":"Sark introduces Stu to Yayos from 55th place on the global leaderboard, works through the stubborn invite flow and passes along the essential pro tip: photograph the medication list.","startSeconds":1695,"videoId":"pcAlKAq1sIA"}],"title":"55th in the World / Stu's Tutorial"},{"id":"yayos_stu_stairs_wipe","segments":[{"endSeconds":2750,"label":"Stu hosts the first attempt while Sark guides him toward the grocery store, but repeated falls on the house steps turn the tutorial run into an immediate reset.","startSeconds":2215,"videoId":"pcAlKAq1sIA"}],"title":"Run 01 - The Stairs Win"},{"id":"yayos_stu_new_personal_best","segments":[{"endSeconds":4335,"label":"The second attempt finally gets serious: meal prep, grocery runs, medication triage and a doomed gambling detour carry Sark and Stu farther than Sark says he ever managed with APL before the pair cash out the run and switch games.","startSeconds":2750,"videoId":"pcAlKAq1sIA"}],"title":"Run 02 - New Personal Best"}],"id":"yayos-stu-night","people":["StuStutters"],"title":"Stu's First Night"}],"id":"yayos","image":"https://static-cdn.jtvnw.net/ttv-boxart/1261431704_IGDB-210x280.jpg","tags":["Co-op","Survival","Simulation","Life Sim","Time Management","Resource Management","Cooking","Comedy","Multiplayer","Gambling"],"title":"Yayos"}}
